---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="content">

  <div class="card welcome-card">
    <h2>welcome back</h2>
    <p>everything About My Profit Land</p>
    <button
      class="button animated-card"
      onclick="window.location.href='https://myprofitland.com/game/Minanashaat'"
    >
      <h2>Register Now <br />
      its FREE</h2>
    </button>
  </div>
<div class="article-card">
    <img src="/imgs/IMG_6769.jpeg" alt="Merge War in MyProfitLand" />
    <div>
        <h3>The Biggest Merge War in MyProfitLand</h3>
        <p>
            A legendary battle between Palestine and El Salvador tested strategy, endurance, and firepower, with hundreds of strikes exchanged.
        </p>
        <button
            class="button"
            onclick="window.location.href='/heighstwar'">
            Read More
        </button>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="article-card">
    <img src="/imgs/vct.png" alt="sVCT Worker Update" />
    <div>
      <h3>Update 18 Feb 2026 – sVCT Rewards for Workers</h3>
      <p>
        A new update in My Profit Land introduces sVCT rewards for Workers,
        reduces the Auto-Hit unlock price, and increases the Moccacino
        storage limit to 150 units. A major step toward expanding benefits
        beyond Warriors.
      </p>
      <button
        class="button"
        onclick="window.location.href='/update18feb2026'"
      >
        Read More
      </button>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="article-card">
    <img src="/imgs/autihitsettings.jpeg" alt="Auto-Hit Feature" />
    <div>
      <h3>New War Tool: Auto-Hit Feature</h3>
      <p>
        MyProfitLand introduces a new tool in wars – the **Auto-Hit** feature, letting you attack or defend on autopilot! 
        Now, you can stock up on weapons and drinks, and let the system do the damage for you.
      </p>
      <button
        class="button"
        onclick="window.location.href='/update16feb2026'"
      >
        Read More
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
      <div class="article-card">
        <img src="/imgs/weaponsstak.jpeg" alt="" />
        <div>
          <h3>Exciting New Updates in MyProfitLand: Weapon Stacking and War Specialist+</h3>
          <p>
            has rolled out some exciting updates that will change the game dynamics for its players.
          </p>
          <button
            class="button"
            onclick="window.location.href='/update14feb2026'"
          >
            Read More
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="cards-grid">

      <div class="article-card">
        <img src="/imgs/vct.png" alt="" />
        <div>
          <h3>War Specialist Status Upgrade via SVCT</h3>
          <p>
            A new update has arrived in <strong>My Profit Land</strong>,
            bringing exciting improvements for war-focused players.
          </p>
          <button
            class="button"
            onclick="window.location.href='/article2'"
          >
            Read More
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="article-card">
        <img src="/imgs/work.png" alt="Worker Guide" />
        <div>
          <h3>👷 Beginner Guide – Worker Path</h3>
          <p>
            New to My Profit Land? Learn the smart way to start as a Worker.
          </p>
          <button
            class="button"
            onclick="window.location.href='/article3'"
          >
            Read More
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="article-card">
        <img src="/imgs/mpllog.PNG" alt="" />
        <div>
          <h3>About My Profitland</h3>
          <p>
            My Profitland is an economy-based game like real life.
          </p>
          <button
            class="button"
            onclick="window.location.href='/article1'"
          >
            Read More
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</main>

</Layout>
